# Accepted vulnerability exceptions for the garuda-firezone image and
# kube/image/src lockfiles. Operator decision 2026-10-31 (firezone-internal#37).
# Re-review everything below at the exp: dates.
# NOTE: trivy parses exp: only inline on the same line as the ID, no space:
# `<ID> exp:YYYY-MM-DD>`. Separate exp: lines are silently ignored.

# hackney 1.25.0 (mix.lock), reachable at runtime only via posthog ~> 0.1
# (the sole runtime consumer pinning hackney ~> 1.20; the fix is 4.x-only and
# wallaby 0.30 caps the line below 3). Firezone touches it only when telemetry
# is enabled, and the chart defaults telemetryEnabled=false.
# CONDITION: telemetry must stay disabled (chart default).
# EEF-CVE-2026-115693 = mix hex.audit CRITICAL; CVE-2026-115693 and
# CVE-2026-47071 = trivy's spellings of the same hackney advisory.
EEF-CVE-2026-115693 exp:2027-05-01
CVE-2026-115693 exp:2027-05-01
CVE-2026-47071 exp:2027-05-01

# tar 6.1.13 (yarn.lock) — build-time only: pulled by node-gyp via the
# un-editable node-sass chain during `yarn install` in the assets stage.
# Not shipped: absent from the runtime image (verified by trivy-image).
CVE-2026-59873 exp:2027-05-01
